 "note": "The owner-visible difference between the two entity-resolution doors, measured over every vector in entity_matching.json. Both columns are produced by the native implementation: the old door is the matcher called with the raw query, accepting a match at ANY tier; the new door is the mutation-safe resolution path, which pre-normalizes the query and refuses low-confidence matches instead of guessing.",
